WEBVTT

00:07:57.356 --> 00:08:00.676
To be held by them and to hold right back.

00:08:00.716 --> 00:08:04.516
Well, that’s community, right
there is strategy in that.

00:08:05.916 --> 00:08:07.076
Then what's my capacity?

00:08:07.116 --> 00:08:08.276
How much can I give?

00:08:08.316 --> 00:08:11.236
Because I got rent, auditions,
I've got to live.

00:08:11.276 --> 00:08:14.596
And when I have my capacity,
I think, well, what's my aim?

00:08:14.876 --> 00:08:17.836
Where am I helpful?
How do I give weight to my claims?

00:08:17.836 --> 00:08:19.836
It's about strategy, right?

00:08:19.876 --> 00:08:21.996
So why integrate?

00:08:22.036 --> 00:08:26.316
Well, I speak to ignite,
connect and always agitate.

00:08:26.316 --> 00:08:27.516
Let's go back.

00:08:27.516 --> 00:08:29.596
Because this is important, agitate.